# Efficient hexane isomers separation in isoreticular bipyrazolate metal-organic frameworks: The role of pore functionalization

Rebecca Vismara\(^{1,\dagger}\), Corrado Di Nicola\(^{2}\), Rodrigo Gil-San Millán\(^{3}\), Kostiantyn V. Domasevich\(^{4}\), Claudio Pettinari\(^{5,6}\), Jorge A. R. Navarro\(^{3}\) (✉), and Simona Galli\(^{1,7}\) (✉)

